{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>超巨型!粟米味牛奶+爆谷脆脆口感</p><p>四面泰全新粟米濃湯刨冰！</p><p>人氣泰式火鍋店「四面泰」推出大熱粟米濃湯刨冰，size巨型超大碗！面層淋上粟米味牛奶，鋪滿爆谷和粟米片，啖啖都是粟米味，味道香濃，刨冰口感綿滑，最適合打完邊爐食！9月1日起供應，數量有限，售完即止。</p><p>四面泰泰式火鍋 官方IG：@fallinthai</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178858801800661884_215636126a9baff2e9efc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178858802099335032_12280460616a9baff6443c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178858802439987005_16216522856a9baff9599af.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178858802704687438_7333018436a9baffbdf8cc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T06:18:23.537279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}